# 🐳 Step 3: Build Docker Image

Navigate to the project directory.

```bash
cd food-ordering-kubernetes
```

Build the Docker image.

```bash
docker build -t cafe-website:v1 .
```

Verify the image.

```bash
docker images
```

Expected Output

```
REPOSITORY              TAG

cafe-website            v1
```

📸 Screenshot

```
screenshots/02-docker-build.png
