# ☸️ Step 8: Install Minikube

Download Minikube.

```bash
curl -LO https://storage.googleapis.com/minikube/releases/latest/minikube-linux-amd64
```

Install Minikube.

```bash
sudo install minikube-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/minikube
```

Verify installation.

```bash
minikube version
```

📸 Screenshot

```
screenshots/08-minikube-version.png
```

